  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Risk Prevention and Mitigation Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de Prevencin y Mitigacin del Riesgo de Desastres Naturales</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyar al pas en la reduccin de perdidas de desastres a travs de inversiones en prevencin y mitigacin, as como en sistemas institucionales para gestin de riesgo de desastres</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the country in the reduction of losses due to disasters through investments in prevention and mitigation, as well as in setting up institutional systems for disaster risk management.</narrative>
  </description>
